---
---
<section class="section bg-cool">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="feature-split reverse">
      <div class="feat-text">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--primary)">Operations</span>
        <span class="script script-lg" style="color:var(--primary)">The Daily Engine</span>
        <h2 class="headline">Run the whole floor, without the busywork.</h2>
        <p class="subhead">Staff-operated check-in, a live view of your whole classroom, and an attendance kanban that reconciles every week. This is the attendance tracking Kumon requires, done deeper: duplicate check-in prevention, no-show flagging, and a lobby board for parents.</p>
        <div class="feat-points">
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-blue">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/><path d="M7 12h10"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><strong style="color:var(--text)">Staff-operated check-in</strong><br>Barcode scan with medical alerts and pickup contacts</div>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-blue">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M12 3v18"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><strong style="color:var(--text)">Attendance kanban</strong><br>Status columns, no-show flagging, and weekly reconciliation</div>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-blue">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="15" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"/><polyline points="17 2 12 7 7 2"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div><strong style="color:var(--text)">Lobby board</strong><br>A parent-facing display of who is checked in</div>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-blue">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m17 2 4 4-4 4"/><path d="M3 11v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"/><path d="m7 22-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M21 13v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Make-up scheduling</strong><br>Reason-coded absences with make-ups, and a vacation range that expands to each class day</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-blue">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"/><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Weekly attendance reconciliation</strong><br>Present, made up, excused, absent, or off schedule, settled every week and honoring closed dates</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-founding" data-cta="Book a Demo">Book a Demo</a>
      </div>
      <div class="feat-visual">
        <div class="blob" aria-hidden="true" style="background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(53,92,170,.16),transparent 68%);width:120%;height:120%;top:-10%;left:-10%"></div>
        <div class="shot"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1984" height="1498" src="/images/live-class-whole.webp" alt="Whole-class live view"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
